{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "story_platnm_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_platnm_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "泡沫",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_platnm_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "5d32c785949cf8008de5ee723350f455d23cf647465f34e6689db469e9dcbaff",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "羅德島本艦\n博士辦公室門口"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerToken": "char_204_platnm_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_204_platnm",
      "portraitKey": "char_204_platnm",
      "text": "呼......呼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerToken": "char_204_platnm_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_204_platnm",
      "portraitKey": "char_204_platnm",
      "text": "嗯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerToken": "char_204_platnm_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_204_platnm",
      "portraitKey": "char_204_platnm",
      "text": "......唔？（哈欠）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerToken": "char_204_platnm_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_204_platnm",
      "portraitKey": "char_204_platnm",
      "text": "瞌睡都打完了，那傢伙還沒回來嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerToken": "char_204_platnm_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_204_platnm",
      "portraitKey": "char_204_platnm",
      "text": "哼......下次直接在博士辦公室裡放寫好的假條吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerToken": "char_204_platnm_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_204_platnm",
      "portraitKey": "char_204_platnm",
      "text": "每次找人請假的時候都去開會，怎麼會這樣啊......早知道就不該答應做一段時間的助理......唔......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerToken": "char_204_platnm_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_204_platnm",
      "portraitKey": "char_204_platnm",
      "text": "......髮梢都有點遮眼睛了......討厭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerToken": "char_204_platnm_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_204_platnm",
      "portraitKey": "char_204_platnm",
      "text": "啊，博士——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerToken": "char_204_platnm_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_204_platnm",
      "portraitKey": "char_204_platnm",
      "text": "——博士？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerToken": "char_204_platnm_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_204_platnm",
      "portraitKey": "char_204_platnm",
      "text": "......怎麼一言不發地走進房間裡了......生氣了嗎？我做了什麼嗎......嗯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerToken": "char_204_platnm_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_204_platnm",
      "portraitKey": "char_204_platnm",
      "text": "不對，應該是沒被發現才對......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerToken": "char_204_platnm_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_204_platnm",
      "portraitKey": "char_204_platnm",
      "text": "喂！博士，我在這裡——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerToken": "char_204_platnm_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_204_platnm",
      "portraitKey": "char_204_platnm",
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerToken": "char_204_platnm_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_204_platnm",
      "portraitKey": "char_204_platnm",
      "text": "這裡是——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "山間湖水環繞的烏薩斯別墅。\n還有一座遠在天邊的高塔。\n直衝雲霄。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "臨光",
      "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
      "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "你來這裡做什麼，無胄盟？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerToken": "char_204_platnm_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_204_platnm",
      "portraitKey": "char_204_platnm",
      "text": "唔，耀騎士......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerToken": "char_204_platnm_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_204_platnm",
      "portraitKey": "char_204_platnm",
      "text": "這句話應該是我問你吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerToken": "char_204_platnm_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_204_platnm",
      "portraitKey": "char_204_platnm",
      "text": "現在我也是羅德島的一員，我當然可以——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "臨光",
      "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
      "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "但這裡可不是羅德島。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerToken": "char_204_platnm_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_204_platnm",
      "portraitKey": "char_204_platnm",
      "text": "......說的也是呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerToken": "char_204_platnm_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_204_platnm",
      "portraitKey": "char_204_platnm",
      "text": "那麼，這裡是哪裡？那座塔又是什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "臨光",
      "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
      "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "這裡......是讓人休息的地方。至於那座塔，我想就得問你自己了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerToken": "char_204_platnm_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_204_platnm",
      "portraitKey": "char_204_platnm",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "白金無言地望著那座高塔。\n陽光的反射使人看不清它的面目，又或是前所未有的角度令人一時間無法辨識。\n但它確實就在那裡，在天邊，如海市蜃樓。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerToken": "char_204_platnm_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_204_platnm",
      "portraitKey": "char_204_platnm",
      "text": "......商業聯合會？那座樓什麼時候如此之高了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "臨光",
      "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
      "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "我們從未離開過。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "臨光",
      "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
      "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "他們也從來沒有變過。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerToken": "char_204_platnm_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_204_platnm",
      "portraitKey": "char_204_platnm",
      "text": "......這可不像耀騎士說的話。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "臨光",
      "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
      "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerToken": "char_204_platnm_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_204_platnm",
      "portraitKey": "char_204_platnm",
      "text": "唔......算了。我只是來找博士的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerToken": "char_204_platnm_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_204_platnm",
      "portraitKey": "char_204_platnm",
      "text": "既然博士不在這裡，那麼就恕我失陪——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "臨光",
      "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
      "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "耀騎士沒有說話，永遠閃閃發光的冠軍沉默地坐在那裡，眺望著大地。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "臨光",
      "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
      "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "......你找博士做什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerToken": "char_204_platnm_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_204_platnm",
      "portraitKey": "char_204_platnm",
      "text": "來羅德島也有一段時間了，只是想找機會享受一些個人時間。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "臨光",
      "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
      "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "是這樣啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "臨光",
      "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
      "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "從那道門出去吧，博士在那。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerToken": "char_204_platnm_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_204_platnm",
      "portraitKey": "char_204_platnm",
      "text": "......謝謝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerToken": "char_204_platnm_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_204_platnm",
      "portraitKey": "char_204_platnm",
      "text": "！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerToken": "char_204_platnm_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_204_platnm",
      "portraitKey": "char_204_platnm",
      "text": "這裡是？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伊",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_209_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "玻利瓦爾度假勝地。溫度適宜服務又好，比北面的小木屋可舒服多了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerToken": "char_204_platnm_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_204_platnm",
      "portraitKey": "char_204_platnm",
      "text": "羅伊......耀騎士之後，是你嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伊",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_209_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "別這樣，說得好像我很煩人一樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伊",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_209_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我們的關係也沒那麼差吧，小白金？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerToken": "char_204_platnm_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_204_platnm",
      "portraitKey": "char_204_platnm",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伊",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_209_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "別這麼拘謹，大家都是來這度假的。炎炎夏日，風情萬種，可別被工作上的事擾了興致。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerToken": "char_204_platnm_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_204_platnm",
      "portraitKey": "char_204_platnm",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伊",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_209_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "放輕鬆點，我給你拿些甜品吧。甜食對持續處於高壓狀態工作的人是有好處的，我相信你贊同這個觀點。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伊",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_209_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "服務員！拿份冰沙給這位小姐！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerToken": "char_204_platnm_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_204_platnm",
      "portraitKey": "char_204_platnm",
      "text": "？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "送到白金面前的冰沙讓她有種似曾相識的感覺。\n杯中的冰沙被堆成大大小小的形狀，還用果醬上了色。\n看上去就像——\n群山中的——\n療養別墅？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伊",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_209_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "度假的時候就別想著什麼不愉快的東西了，它就在那裡，你也改變不了什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伊",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_209_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "還是說，只要它出現，你的注意力就會被奪走？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerToken": "char_204_platnm_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_204_platnm",
      "portraitKey": "char_204_platnm",
      "text": "唔......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伊",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_209_1#6",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那好不容易給你申請的長期休假豈不是一點用都沒了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伊",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_209_1#6",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "要不你先回去一趟，解決了再回來度假，怎麼樣？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerToken": "char_204_platnm_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_204_platnm",
      "portraitKey": "char_204_platnm",
      "text": "解決......什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伊",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_209_1#6",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這可就要問你自己了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伊",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_209_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "沒問題的，其他麻煩事包在我身上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伊",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_209_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不過你得快點。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "羅伊指了指遠方的光點。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伊",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_209_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "畢竟大家都有害怕的東西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "白金望向遠方，那是三支絞在一起的玄鐵巨箭，一邊飛馳，一邊在空中發出刺耳的嘯聲。\n很快，又不那麼快。快到下一秒就會貫穿白金的身體，又慢到追不上街邊路人的腳步。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerToken": "char_204_platnm_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_204_platnm",
      "portraitKey": "char_204_platnm",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伊",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_209_1#6",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "知道怎麼回大騎士領吧，小白金。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerToken": "char_204_platnm_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_204_platnm",
      "portraitKey": "char_204_platnm",
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伊",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_209_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那就好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerToken": "char_204_platnm_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_204_platnm",
      "portraitKey": "char_204_platnm",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerToken": "char_204_platnm_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_204_platnm",
      "portraitKey": "char_204_platnm",
      "text": "您......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伊",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_209_1#6",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerToken": "char_204_platnm_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_204_platnm",
      "portraitKey": "char_204_platnm",
      "text": "您的頭髮，我覺得還是黑色比較適合。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "沒等神情錯愕的羅伊發出半點笑聲，白金就轉頭躍入了水中。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "她對羅伊的反應不感興趣，她只是想這麼說一句。\n想了很久了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "騎探",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_223",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "欣特萊雅小姐，欣特萊雅小姐？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerToken": "char_204_platnm_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_204_platnm",
      "portraitKey": "char_204_platnm",
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerToken": "char_204_platnm_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_204_platnm",
      "portraitKey": "char_204_platnm",
      "text": "有什麼事嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "騎探",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_223",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "請問您有興趣來參加騎士海選嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerToken": "char_204_platnm_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_204_platnm",
      "portraitKey": "char_204_platnm",
      "text": "沒有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "不去理會身後緊緊追趕的騎探，白金向著商業聯合會大樓疾馳而去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "在她的想像中，商業聯合會裡應該像大騎士領一樣人頭攢動。\n但這裡只有雕像，各式各樣的雕像，潔白純淨的雕像。\n前台的接待員、門口的警備員、走道裡的工作人員......\n全部定格在了一個未知的時刻。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerToken": "char_204_platnm_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_204_platnm",
      "portraitKey": "char_204_platnm",
      "text": "這下可難辦了，我可沒有前往董事活動區域的授權啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerToken": "char_204_platnm_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_204_platnm",
      "portraitKey": "char_204_platnm",
      "text": "電梯門打不開，樓梯間也進不去，暗道也被封死了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerToken": "char_204_platnm_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_204_platnm",
      "portraitKey": "char_204_platnm",
      "text": "唔......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerToken": "char_204_platnm_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_204_platnm",
      "portraitKey": "char_204_platnm",
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "光芒順著中央天井灑下，把整個一樓大廳照得光亮異常。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerToken": "char_204_platnm_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_204_platnm",
      "portraitKey": "char_204_platnm",
      "text": "......我記得，我應該是天馬來著？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "向著天空所在的方向，白金一躍而起。\n她沒有如想像中那般落下，而是越升越高，越升越快，向著光芒的盡頭飛去。\n溫暖的陽光慢慢將她包裹——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "黑暗也隨之降臨。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "白金小姐！請不要睡在這裡！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerToken": "char_204_platnm_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_204_platnm",
      "portraitKey": "char_204_platnm",
      "text": "......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "睡得真熟啊。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "白金",
          "speakerToken": "char_204_platnm_1#3",
          "operatorId": "char_204_platnm",
          "portraitKey": "char_204_platnm",
          "text": "唔......抱歉......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "白金",
          "speakerToken": "char_204_platnm_1#2",
          "operatorId": "char_204_platnm",
          "portraitKey": "char_204_platnm",
          "text": "{@nickname}，可算找到你了......費了我不少事啊。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "費事是指睡在走廊上嗎？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "白金",
          "speakerToken": "char_204_platnm_1#3",
          "operatorId": "char_204_platnm",
          "portraitKey": "char_204_platnm",
          "text": "......嘖。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "白金",
          "speakerToken": "char_204_platnm_1#5",
          "operatorId": "char_204_platnm",
          "portraitKey": "char_204_platnm",
          "text": "你什麼都沒看見，對吧？"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "是我把你喊醒的，怎麼可能——",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "白金",
          "speakerToken": "char_204_platnm_1#6",
          "operatorId": "char_204_platnm",
          "portraitKey": "char_204_platnm",
          "text": "不，你什麼都沒看到，對、吧？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "白金",
          "speakerToken": "char_204_platnm_1#3",
          "operatorId": "char_204_platnm",
          "portraitKey": "char_204_platnm",
          "text": "......算了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "白金",
          "speakerToken": "char_204_platnm_1#1",
          "operatorId": "char_204_platnm",
          "portraitKey": "char_204_platnm",
          "text": "喏。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "假條？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "白金",
          "speakerToken": "char_204_platnm_1#1",
          "operatorId": "char_204_platnm",
          "portraitKey": "char_204_platnm",
          "text": "......我想請個長假。離開羅德島，去遠一些的地方，嗯，散散心。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "白金",
          "speakerToken": "char_204_platnm_1#1",
          "operatorId": "char_204_platnm",
          "portraitKey": "char_204_platnm",
          "text": "你會同意的，對吧？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "白金",
          "speakerToken": "char_204_platnm_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_204_platnm",
          "portraitKey": "char_204_platnm",
          "text": "啊。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "白金",
          "speakerToken": "char_204_platnm_1#3",
          "operatorId": "char_204_platnm",
          "portraitKey": "char_204_platnm",
          "text": "難道說，博士......你想當我的旅伴嗎？也不是不行吧，正好一起——"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "行啊。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "白金",
          "speakerToken": "char_204_platnm_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_204_platnm",
          "portraitKey": "char_204_platnm",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "白金",
          "speakerToken": "char_204_platnm_1#5",
          "operatorId": "char_204_platnm",
          "portraitKey": "char_204_platnm",
          "text": "呃......哪件事？旅伴還是批假？"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "兩件事。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": []
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "而且，現在就走。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "白金",
          "speakerToken": "char_204_platnm_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_204_platnm",
          "portraitKey": "char_204_platnm",
          "text": "啊......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "白金",
          "speakerToken": "char_204_platnm_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_204_platnm",
          "portraitKey": "char_204_platnm",
          "text": "不是，至少得給我點時間打點行李......"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "你啊，就這點小小的願望，已經拖延了多久了？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "白金",
          "speakerToken": "char_204_platnm_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_204_platnm",
          "portraitKey": "char_204_platnm",
          "text": "等、等等——別拉我——"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "再次睜開雙眼後，映入眼簾的是她最為熟悉，也最為厭惡的事物。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "白金",
          "speakerToken": "char_204_platnm_1#1",
          "operatorId": "char_204_platnm",
          "portraitKey": "char_204_platnm",
          "text": "又是電話嗎......唉......"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "白金",
          "speakerToken": "char_204_platnm_1#1",
          "operatorId": "char_204_platnm",
          "portraitKey": "char_204_platnm",
          "text": "這下就不會再——"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "電話在上一刻被砸得粉碎，下一秒卻又恢復如初，開始發出噪音。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "白金",
          "speakerToken": "char_204_platnm_1#6",
          "operatorId": "char_204_platnm",
          "portraitKey": "char_204_platnm",
          "text": "所以你就不能消停些嗎？"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "白金",
          "speakerToken": "char_204_platnm_1#6",
          "operatorId": "char_204_platnm",
          "portraitKey": "char_204_platnm",
          "text": "還真是沒完沒了......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "白金",
          "speakerToken": "char_204_platnm_1#6",
          "operatorId": "char_204_platnm",
          "portraitKey": "char_204_platnm",
          "text": "（拿起聽筒）"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "白金",
          "speakerToken": "char_204_platnm_1#6",
          "operatorId": "char_204_platnm",
          "portraitKey": "char_204_platnm",
          "text": "喂。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "白金大位，你越界了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "白金",
          "speakerToken": "char_204_platnm_1#6",
          "operatorId": "char_204_platnm",
          "portraitKey": "char_204_platnm",
          "text": "是，是，真的很不好意思。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "白金",
          "speakerToken": "char_204_platnm_1#6",
          "operatorId": "char_204_platnm",
          "portraitKey": "char_204_platnm",
          "text": "所以呢？"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "商業聯合會的權威絕不允許你如此踐踏。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "白金",
          "speakerToken": "char_204_platnm_1#1",
          "operatorId": "char_204_platnm",
          "portraitKey": "char_204_platnm",
          "text": "哦。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "白金",
          "speakerToken": "char_204_platnm_1#1",
          "operatorId": "char_204_platnm",
          "portraitKey": "char_204_platnm",
          "text": "（把聽筒放在一邊）"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "白金",
          "speakerToken": "char_204_platnm_1#1",
          "operatorId": "char_204_platnm",
          "portraitKey": "char_204_platnm",
          "text": "你想說就說個痛快吧。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "speakerToken": "char_204_platnm_1#1",
          "operatorId": "char_204_platnm",
          "portraitKey": "char_204_platnm",
          "text": "——"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "白金",
          "speakerToken": "char_204_platnm_1#2",
          "operatorId": "char_204_platnm",
          "portraitKey": "char_204_platnm",
          "text": "請繼續，我先在這休息一會。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "白金",
          "speakerToken": "char_204_platnm_1#2",
          "operatorId": "char_204_platnm",
          "portraitKey": "char_204_platnm",
          "text": "唔，沒記錯的話這裡應該有藏酒。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "白金",
          "speakerToken": "char_204_platnm_1#1",
          "operatorId": "char_204_platnm",
          "portraitKey": "char_204_platnm",
          "text": "哈啊，果然......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "白金",
          "speakerToken": "char_204_platnm_1#1",
          "operatorId": "char_204_platnm",
          "portraitKey": "char_204_platnm",
          "text": "（打開瓶塞）"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "白金",
          "speakerToken": "char_204_platnm_1#1",
          "operatorId": "char_204_platnm",
          "portraitKey": "char_204_platnm",
          "text": "（倒上半杯酒）"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "白金",
          "speakerToken": "char_204_platnm_1#1",
          "operatorId": "char_204_platnm",
          "portraitKey": "char_204_platnm",
          "text": "呼嗯。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "在卡西米爾的夜空下，玄鐵箭正在不斷放大。\n如同流星一般劃過夜空，大騎士領萬家燈火也遮不住它的光芒。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "白金",
          "speakerToken": "char_204_platnm_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_204_platnm",
          "portraitKey": "char_204_platnm",
          "text": "這個是......蘇打水？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "白金",
          "speakerToken": "char_204_platnm_1#1",
          "operatorId": "char_204_platnm",
          "portraitKey": "char_204_platnm",
          "text": "原來他們喝的不全是酒？呼......也行吧，畢竟我也不太喜歡這種酒......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "白金",
          "speakerToken": "char_204_platnm_1#1",
          "operatorId": "char_204_platnm",
          "portraitKey": "char_204_platnm",
          "text": "（倒上半杯蘇打水）"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "白金",
          "speakerToken": "char_204_platnm_1#1",
          "operatorId": "char_204_platnm",
          "portraitKey": "char_204_platnm",
          "text": "敬卡西米爾。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "白金",
          "speakerToken": "char_204_platnm_1#1",
          "operatorId": "char_204_platnm",
          "portraitKey": "char_204_platnm",
          "text": "我的，還有你們的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "白金",
          "speakerToken": "char_204_platnm_1#1",
          "operatorId": "char_204_platnm",
          "portraitKey": "char_204_platnm",
          "text": "（將蘇打水倒在電話上）"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "當水落在電話上時，聽筒裡傳來激烈的咒駡聲。但當蘇打水全部澆下，電話發出一陣聲響，再也沒了聲音。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "白金",
          "speakerToken": "char_204_platnm_1#1",
          "operatorId": "char_204_platnm",
          "portraitKey": "char_204_platnm",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "白金",
          "speakerToken": "char_204_platnm_1#1",
          "operatorId": "char_204_platnm",
          "portraitKey": "char_204_platnm",
          "text": "那麼，當箭射穿高塔後，會發生什麼呢？"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_211_1#1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "你似乎在期待些什麼。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "白金",
          "speakerToken": "char_204_platnm_1#1",
          "operatorId": "char_204_platnm",
          "portraitKey": "char_204_platnm",
          "text": "馬克維茨，你怎麼在這裡？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "馬克維茨",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_211_1#1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "許久不見，白金大位。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "馬克維茨",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_211_1#1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我一直在。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "白金",
          "speakerToken": "char_204_platnm_1#1",
          "operatorId": "char_204_platnm",
          "portraitKey": "char_204_platnm",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "馬克維茨",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_211_1#1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我可以回答你的問題。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "馬克維茨",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_211_1#1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "“當箭射穿高塔後，會發生什麼呢？”"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "馬克維茨",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_211_1#1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "什麼都不會。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "白金",
          "speakerToken": "char_204_platnm_1#1",
          "operatorId": "char_204_platnm",
          "portraitKey": "char_204_platnm",
          "text": "......真糟糕。我怎麼會在夢裡把你和博士弄混了呢？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "馬克維茨",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_211_1#1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "夢是不被自己控制的，欣特萊雅。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "恰爾內",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_106",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我可以是任何人。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "你害怕的人。\n你可憐的人。\n你感興趣的人。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "恰爾內",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_106",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我們一起構成了你始終放不下的，你害怕的，那座塔。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "恰爾內",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_106",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "你在那裡長大，那裡就是你的未來，你逃了出去，你還是覺得自己無處可去，你其實茫然無措。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "白金",
          "speakerToken": "char_204_platnm_1#1",
          "operatorId": "char_204_platnm",
          "portraitKey": "char_204_platnm",
          "text": "......塔？"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "白金無言地望向自己的夢境。\n應和著他的宣言，天花板向外翻開，露出卡西米爾聯合會大樓的最上層。\n那裡沒有席位，也沒有電話。\n只有如同樹木一般，向著夜空無限延伸的枝節，照這勢頭生長下去，終有一日，日月都將被納入其中。\n每一根枝節，都由不同材質打造而成。\n鋼鐵、報紙、木料、穀物。\n性質相異的物質在此處融為一體。\n而其中一節，充滿利刺，遍佈箭頭，在風中發出刺耳呼嘯。\n白金覺得自己站在一隻巨獸的頭顱上，它的羽翼伸向天空，它的根系深扎大地。\n它的骨骼用各種材質焊接，血管裡則流動著各種紙幣。\n而白金自己，也曾是其中一個微不足道的細胞。\n但現在？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "白金",
          "speakerToken": "char_204_platnm_1#1",
          "operatorId": "char_204_platnm",
          "portraitKey": "char_204_platnm",
          "text": "事實或許是這樣，卡西米爾。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "白金",
          "speakerToken": "char_204_platnm_1#1",
          "operatorId": "char_204_platnm",
          "portraitKey": "char_204_platnm",
          "text": "但是——"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "白金",
          "speakerToken": "char_204_platnm_1#6",
          "operatorId": "char_204_platnm",
          "portraitKey": "char_204_platnm",
          "text": "——我拒絕。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "白金心中默念著一個人的名字，隨後撞碎玻璃，從視窗躍下。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "白金",
          "speakerToken": "char_204_platnm_1#6",
          "operatorId": "char_204_platnm",
          "portraitKey": "char_204_platnm",
          "text": "再也別見了，卡西米爾。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "白金",
          "speakerToken": "char_204_platnm_1#6",
          "operatorId": "char_204_platnm",
          "portraitKey": "char_204_platnm",
          "text": "我還想過新生活呢。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "白金",
          "speakerToken": "char_204_platnm_1#6",
          "operatorId": "char_204_platnm",
          "portraitKey": "char_204_platnm",
          "text": "疼......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "白金",
          "speakerToken": "char_204_platnm_1#6",
          "operatorId": "char_204_platnm",
          "portraitKey": "char_204_platnm",
          "text": "啊，你接住了啊。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "白金",
          "speakerToken": "char_204_platnm_1#6",
          "operatorId": "char_204_platnm",
          "portraitKey": "char_204_platnm",
          "text": "我就知道你可以，真可靠。總之也不是第一次了，對吧。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "白金",
          "speakerToken": "char_204_platnm_1#6",
          "operatorId": "char_204_platnm",
          "portraitKey": "char_204_platnm",
          "text": "那麼，這是哪呢？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "白金",
          "speakerToken": "char_204_platnm_1#6",
          "operatorId": "char_204_platnm",
          "portraitKey": "char_204_platnm",
          "text": "{@nickname}？"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "白金",
          "speakerToken": "char_204_platnm_1#6",
          "operatorId": "char_204_platnm",
          "portraitKey": "char_204_platnm",
          "text": "原來還有你也不知道的地方啊。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "白金",
          "speakerToken": "char_204_platnm_1#6",
          "operatorId": "char_204_platnm",
          "portraitKey": "char_204_platnm",
          "text": "真稀奇。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "白金",
          "speakerToken": "char_204_platnm_1#6",
          "operatorId": "char_204_platnm",
          "portraitKey": "char_204_platnm",
          "text": "啊，先別把我放下來，我不太想動，讓這個糟糕的夢早點結束吧。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "白金",
          "speakerToken": "char_204_platnm_1#6",
          "operatorId": "char_204_platnm",
          "portraitKey": "char_204_platnm",
          "text": "反正是夢，你也沒什麼損失，再多抱一會吧。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "白金",
          "speakerToken": "char_204_platnm_1#6",
          "operatorId": "char_204_platnm",
          "portraitKey": "char_204_platnm",
          "text": "我得集中思緒，清理下腦袋。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "白金",
          "speakerToken": "char_204_platnm_1#6",
          "operatorId": "char_204_platnm",
          "portraitKey": "char_204_platnm",
          "text": "讓卡西米爾那些奇怪的東西趕緊從我腦子裡消失。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
